/target
# 构建产物目录必须锚定在仓库根：裸写 `build` 会匹配任意层级的同名目录，
# 而文档站的内容目录里就有一个 `docs/docs/development-guide/build/` ——
# 它被静默忽略过，文件没能提交，CI 的 onBrokenLinks 于是报断链。
#
# The build-output directory has to be anchored at the repository root: a bare `build` matches a
# directory of that name at any depth, and the docs content tree has one
# (`docs/docs/development-guide/build/`). That is what silently kept those pages out of the commit and
# made CI's `onBrokenLinks` report a broken link.
/build
/configure
.idea
duckdb_unittest_tempdir
/test/bin
venv

/.codebuddy
/.trae
/.qoder
.vscode
.mcp.json
/test/sql/*.html

# test/sql 下只跟踪 .test：落盘测试写出来的 HTML 之类产物一律忽略。
# 顺序要紧 —— 最后一条规则生效，所以 `!` 必须写在 `*` 之后。
#
# Only .test files are tracked under test/sql; artefacts such as the HTML a persistence test writes are
# ignored. Order matters — the last matching rule wins, so the `!` line has to come after the `*`.
test/sql/*.*
!test/sql/*.test


/*.html

